WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.596
Two ablations.

00:00:03.676 --> 00:00:07.272
Encoder capacity confirms the theory: when the
final linear layer is at least the batch size,

00:00:07.352 --> 00:00:10.948
samples match; smaller, some collapse.

00:00:11.028 --> 00:00:14.624
On images, the Metropolis-Hastings step stabilizes
training,

00:00:14.704 --> 00:00:18.300
while iteration count barely matters beyond two.
